        "answer": "VA requires direct deposit to receive payment on a CHAMPVA reimbursement claim. That requirement operates within the broader federal electronic-payment framework: Treasury says federal payments generally must be delivered by electronic funds transfer under 31 U.S.C. § 3332 and 31 CFR Part 208, subject to applicable waiver rules.",
