        "answer": "No. A newborn may qualify, but VA still requires enrollment. VA currently instructs families to obtain the newborn's Social Security number, add the child as a dependent of the Veteran sponsor, and then apply for CHAMPVA. VA says it cannot pay the newborn's medical claims until the child is enrolled.",
