        "answer": "CHAMPVA can cover genetic testing when it is medically appropriate and necessary for a covered medical purpose. VA guidance describes testing used to diagnose a disease or syndrome and specifically references BRCA1/BRCA2 testing, while routine or demand genetic testing is excluded.",
