        "answer": "CHAMPVA can cover medically necessary skilled nursing and skilled nursing facility care, but it does not cover a nursing-home stay simply because the patient needs long-term assistance. Federal CHAMPVA rules exclude custodial care, inpatient stays primarily for domiciliary care, and services from certain non-skilled institutions.",
