        "answer": "Mail the completed current VA Form 10-7959A and supporting documents to VHA Office of Integrated Veteran Care, CHAMPVA Claims, PO Box 500, Spring City, PA 19475. Re-check the current VA claim page or form before mailing because routing information can change.",
