        "answer": "Yes. CHAMPVA is not limited to a home-state medical provider network. You can receive covered, medically necessary care from an authorized non-VA provider in another state, subject to the same ordinary coverage, medical-necessity, preauthorization, other-insurance, cost-sharing, and claim rules.",
